$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Omicron Argentis VI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> return after the first battle on Omicron Argentis VI.  The first battle ended with a Diamond Sword victory.  Once the Blood Eagle were driven from the planet they set up a communications base and dug-in in case of a siege.  The Blood Eagle feeling a need for revenge return to the planet and take a ancient Titan ruins for a base.  After completing the base essentials, the base was discovered, this battle ensued.....Find the enemy flags in the defended underground bunkers of each team.  Map By: [HvC]Leviathan";
